flowchart TB
    subgraph CloudRun[Cloud Run: one Python worker, Node MCP subprocesses]
        API[FastAPI POST /chat or /chat/stream] --> Client[AgentClient: session lookup and per-session lock]
        Client <--> Memory[SDK SQLiteSession: in-memory conversation history]
        subgraph AgentGraph[Agents SDK state and execution graph]
            Entry[Runner entry] --> Model[Model request]
            Model --> Decide{Tool call or final answer?}
            Decide -->|final| Final[Return answer]
            Decide -->|tool calls| ToolStep[Execute tools and append results]
            ToolStep --> Model
        end
        Client --> Entry
        Final --> API
        ToolStep <--> Wrapper[ObservedMCPServer / SDK MCP client]
        Wrapper <-->|tools/list and tools/call over stdio| Files[Filesystem MCP: data directory]
        Wrapper <-->|tools/list and tools/call over stdio| Search[Tavily MCP: search and extract]
        Wrapper <-->|tools/list and tools/call over stdio| Weather[Open-Meteo MCP: geocoding and forecast]
    end
    User[Browser or API caller] -->|query and session_id| API
    API -->|final response or activity stream| User
    Model <-->|OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions| NIM[NVIDIA NIM cloud model]
    Search <--> Tavily[Tavily web API]
    Weather <--> Meteo[Open-Meteo web APIs]
